  "solution": {
    "text": "A -2&nbsp; [3<sup><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">o</span></sup>&nbsp; carbocation with cross conjugation]<br />B - 1 [2<sup>o</sup>&nbsp; carbocation with extended conjugation ]<br />C - 3 [3<sup><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">o</span></sup>&nbsp; carbocation with 4&nbsp;hyperconjugations&nbsp;and +I of 3 alkyl groups]<br />D - 4 [​2<sup><span style=\"font-size: 10.8333px;\">o</span></sup>&nbsp; carbocation with 2&nbsp;hyperconjugations&nbsp;and +I of 2 alkyl groups]<br />So order will be<br />A&nbsp;→&nbsp;2, B →&nbsp;1, C → 3, D → 4&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;",
